                <mxCell id="sla-cache-hit-commit" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.4&quot;&gt;原子写入余额、已兑现轮号，更新 Q&lt;br&gt;\(\mathrm{Credit}_x=\sum_a c_{a,x},\quad H_x=L+\mathrm{Credit}_x/b_x\)&lt;br&gt;本次不推进 L，不复制额外备份&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK SC;fontSize=27;fontColor=#000000;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=12;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;rounded=1;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
